<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.90 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.90 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 6.90 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for March 18		   18,000</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for March	    6,327</p>
<p> Average reserves to March 13			 5,537</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,901</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
